# Controls what `gcloud builds submit` uploads as the build source.
#
# This is NOT .dockerignore — that one still applies, but only to the
# `docker build` context once Cloud Build has the tarball. Without this file
# gcloud auto-generates one from .gitignore semantics and writes it into the
# tree, which would also drag .venv into the upload.
#
# Keep in sync with local.mcp_source_exclude in terraform/images.tf: the image
# tag is a hash of everything not excluded there, so anything ignored here but
# hashed there would rebuild an identical image under a new tag.
.git/
.gitignore
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
